{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne click, one Gaggi \u2013 endless fun with more updates to come!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Gaggi Clicker</strong>, every click earns you new <strong>Gaggis</strong>.<br>As your numbers increase, you unlock upgrades that<br>\u2013 boost your click power or<br>\u2013 generate Gaggis automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the faster your production grows \u2013 and you rise through the <strong>level system</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click &amp; collect</strong> \u2013 every click gives you Gaggis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> boost your production and unlock new features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-clickers</strong> generate Gaggis even while idle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige system</strong>: restart from scratch \u2013 but with permanent bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level system &amp; statistics</strong> for long-term motivation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More content is on the way!</strong><br>With upcoming <strong>updates</strong>, even more content, features, and surprises will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game goal:</strong><br>Produce <strong>as many Gaggis as possible</strong> and grow endlessly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3467760?t=1772779730","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3467760?t=1772779730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467760/87d60b8e57e97c2a35a5b3cd2da952f19384a171/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772779730","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3467760/87d60b8e57e97c2a35a5b3cd2d